# Variadic param collects both excess positional args (integer-keyed) and unmatched named args (string-keyed)
# This test demonstrates B-277: ...rest collects ALL remaining args into a mixed Dict
[f: [fn [let x ...rest] rest]
 result: [f 1 2 3 y: 4 z: 5]]
=== out
Dict({"f": Function(x, rest), "result": Dict({0: Int(2), 1: Int(3), "y": Int(4), "z": Int(5)})})

=== warn
unknown named argument: function has no parameter named 'y' at 3:22-3:23
unknown named argument: function has no parameter named 'z' at 3:27-3:28
